  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned just moments from the beach in sought-after Rothesay Bay, this exceptional cedar and brick home and income property presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium coastal lifestyle with the added advantage of substantial rental potential.\r\n\r\nSet well back from the road in an elevated, private and sun-drenched position, this beautifully constructed five bedroom property combines timeless materials, sea views and a sense of tranquility that is increasingly hard to find. With its established setting, excellent versatility and two separate living options, this property offers far more than meets the eye.\r\n\r\nThe main residence features three bedrooms, generous outdoor living and entertaining decks, and lovely sea views that provide the perfect backdrop for relaxed coastal living. Whether enjoying your morning coffee in the sunshine, entertaining friends over long summer evenings or simply unwinding after a day at the beach, this home embraces the very best of the Bays lifestyle. A double garage adds practicality, with room for the essentials that come with an active coastal life.\r\n\r\nAdding considerable appeal is the separate, legal two-bedroom accommodation, complete with its own internal-access garage. Ideal for extended family, visiting guests or those looking to supplement their income, this additional dwelling provides flexibility and independence while remaining part of one substantial property.\r\n\r\nWith the potential to generate approximately $1,500 per week in combined rental income, this property offers an exciting proposition for investors and owner-occupiers alike. Indicative figures comprise approximately $900 per week for the main residence and $600 per week for the separate two-bedroom accommodation. These figures are potential rental estimates only and should be independently verified.\r\n\r\nLive in one and rent the other, accommodate extended family, or explore the possibilities of maximising the income from both dwellings. The choice is yours, with the benefit of a coastal location that is always in demand.\r\n\r\nHere, the beach is not simply a weekend destination; it becomes part of your everyday life. Launch the boat, enjoy a morning swim, take leisurely evening walks along the sand or spend sun-filled afternoons entertaining friends and family. Discover the pleasure of living close to the water, with the convenience of lovely local cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities nearby.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the highly sought-after local school zones, making this an appealing choice for those wanting to put down roots in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nPrivate, secure and beautifully elevated, this is a property where quality construction meets lifestyle, flexibility and income potential. The timeless combination of cedar and brick, the lovely sea views, the generous outdoor living and the additional legal accommodation create an offering that is both distinctive and compelling.\r\n\r\nOur owners are committed to selling, presenting an outstanding opportunity for buyers ready to secure a slice of the Rothesay Bay coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhether you are searching for a beautiful home by the beach, a property with supplementary income, room for extended family or a strategic investment in a premium coastal location, this deserves your immediate attention.\r\n\r\nEmbrace the lifestyle. Unlock the potential. Make Rothesay Bay your next move.",
